#
# N6a - a compensation typed as the receipt of the effect it addresses. That collapses
# the counteraction into the thing counteracted, which is the guaranteed-inverse reading
# that makes a failed compensation invisible.
# MUST trip logic:CompensationNotInverseConstraint.

@prefix logic: <https://blackcatinformatics.ca/logic/> .
@prefix rdfs:  <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#> .
@prefix xsd:   <http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#> .
@prefix ex:    <https://blackcatinformatics.ca/gmeow/examples/logic/tests/> .

ex:compensationAsInverse a logic:CompensationAttempt ,
        logic:ExternalEffectReceipt ;
    rdfs:label "a compensation typed as the very receipt it addresses"@en .
